{%- comment -%} "Three ways to gift" cards: ready to ship / semi-customised / custom curated. {%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  .mg-ways { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: clamp(.9rem, 2vw, 1.4rem); }
  .mg-way { position: relative; background: linear-gradient(160deg, #1b1814, #121110); border: 1px solid var(--mg-line); border-radius: 18px; padding: 1.8rem 1.5rem 1.6rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .mg-way:hover { border-color: var(--mg-line-gold); }
  .mg-way__n { font-family: var(--mg-serif); font-size: 2.6rem; line-height: 1; color: rgba(201,162,39,.35); position: absolute; top: 1.1rem; right: 1.3rem; }
  .mg-way__ic { width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(201,162,39,.12); border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,.45); color: #f3c969; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .mg-way__ic svg { width: 26px; height: 26px; }
  .mg-way h3 { font-family: var(--mg-serif); color: #faf7f0; font-size: 1.35rem; margin: 0 0 .55rem; }
  .mg-way p { color: var(--mg-muted); font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 1.2rem; flex: 1; }
  .mg-way__meta { font-size: .76rem; color: #e8e0cc; margin: 0 0 1.1rem; display: flex; gap: .4rem; flex-wrap: wrap; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .mg-way__meta li { border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,.35); border-radius: 999px; padding: .25rem .6rem; }
  @media (max-width: 899px) { .mg-ways { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
<section aria-labelledby="mg-ways-h">
  <div class="mg-head">
    <p class="mg-head__eyebrow">What makes us different</p>
    <h2 class="mg-head__title" id="mg-ways-h">Three ways to gift with Meru</h2>
    <p class="mg-head__sub">Pick off the shelf, brand what you see, or have us build something from scratch. One team handles sourcing, branding, packing and delivery.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mg-ways">
    <article class="mg-way">
      <span class="mg-way__n" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
      <div class="mg-way__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7l9-4 9 4-9 4-9-4Z"/><path d="M3 7v10l9 4 9-4V7M12 11v10"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Ready to Ship</h3>
      <p>Hampers and gift sets already curated and in stock, ideal for onboarding, client thank-yous and last-minute festive orders.</p>
      <ul class="mg-way__meta"><li>Fastest dispatch</li><li>Fixed pricing</li></ul>
      <a class="mg-btn mg-btn--outline mg-btn--sm" href="/collections/corporate-gift-hampers">Shop ready hampers</a>
    </article>
    <article class="mg-way">
      <span class="mg-way__n" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
      <div class="mg-way__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 20h4l10-10-4-4L4 16v4Z"/><path d="m13.5 6.5 4 4"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Semi-Customised</h3>
      <p>Like a hamper on our site? We put your logo on the products, the box and the card so it feels entirely your own.</p>
      <ul class="mg-way__meta"><li>Logo on every piece</li><li>Free mock-up</li></ul>
      <a class="mg-btn mg-btn--outline mg-btn--sm" href="/pages/bulk-enquiry">Enquire now</a>
    </article>
    <article class="mg-way">
      <span class="mg-way__n" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
      <div class="mg-way__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L12 16.4 6.7 19.1l1-5.8L3.5 9.2l5.9-.9L12 3Z"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Custom Curated</h3>
      <p>Our gifting stylists design a one-of-a-kind kit around your brief, budget and brand, from product sourcing to printed packaging.</p>
      <ul class="mg-way__meta"><li>Dedicated stylist</li><li>Custom packaging</li></ul>
      <a class="mg-btn mg-btn--outline mg-btn--sm" href="/pages/bulk-enquiry">Talk to a stylist</a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
